The text of the standard (xml/*.xml) is original work of the Dualayer
Hierarchy Standard Project contributors, licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0
(see LICENSE).

The build system follows the Filesystem Hierarchy Standard project:
  https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/FHS/fhs-spec
The following files come from it, unchanged or adapted:
  Makefile (rewritten for xsltproc, structure kept)
  util/files-from-rules.xsl
  util/update-xmlfiles.py
  docbook/schemas/   (DocBook 5 RELAX NG schemas, OASIS)
  docbook/xsl/       (DocBook XSL stylesheets, see docbook/xsl/docsrc/license.xml)
docbook/dhs.css, docbook/dhs-chunk.xsl and docbook/docbook-html-utf8.xsl
are new.

Thanks to the editors and contributors of the FHS, whose work since
1994 this standard builds on.
